@startuml discussion-engine-delphi
title Delphi Discussion Engine - Structured Rating Flow

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

component "DiscussionService._run" as service
component "initialize round" as initialize
component "select next persona" as select
component "Delphi persona turn" as persona
component "validate rating\nand revision" as validate
component "persist turn" as persist
component "round summary\nand anonymous feedback" as feedback
component "next round\nor terminate" as termination
component "DelphiAnalyzer" as analyzer
database "Persisted discussion" as store

service --> initialize : create engine
initialize --> select
select --> persona : next persona
select --> feedback : all personas complete
persona --> validate : one or more Delphi items
validate --> persist : structured response
persist --> select : more personas
persist --> feedback : persona complete
feedback --> termination
termination --> initialize : next round
termination --> analyzer : final round
analyzer --> store : persist metrics
persist --> store : persist ratings and revisions

note right of initialize
Round 1 collects initial ratings.
Later rounds receive aggregated feedback.
end note

note right of feedback
Summarizes rating distributions,
arguments and remaining disagreement.
end note

note right of termination
Stops at the configured maximum
rounds or when stopRequested is set.
end note
@enduml
